    kind: work_item  # 23a4
    title: "verify-claims: measure, then disclose, the unseeded web ingress -- route handlers exist but no untrusted_input source is placed at them, and today the clean verdict is withheld only by an unrelated 'framework module unclassified' reason"  # 23a4
    status: todo_hard  # 23a4
    priority: 2  # 23a4
    parent:  # 23a4
