  message: "Precedent to read before designing step 1: INV-dabov (satisfied), the same false-CONFIRMED shape one level up -- a language with an analyzer but no io_primitives catalogue confirmed rc 0 until a disclosure named it. The step-1 disclosure is that cure applied to framework ingress. Filed together with WI-jomik on 2026-11-01 from the meta-analysis question in this session; the later steps (WI-ritog tier 1, the ADR-0017 4a summaries in WI-famig/WI-potan, globals in WI-zitul) are separate items and are NOT pre-approved by this entry."  # 3eb0
- op: discuss  # 80e1
  at: '2026-11-02T06:12:50Z'  # 80e1
